window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>He wants to set her soul alight. She wants to watch him burn . . .</p> <p>I made a mistake, now he's going to make me pay.</p> <p>Meet Kyt, the rogue alien warrior version of a playboy. He's all devilish good looks and angelic alien badness. He lives for the party, until my nearly catastrophic error means he's put in charge of me.</p> <p>Playboy no longer, he's just become the boss from hell and he's in the perfect position to ensure I do his every bidding.</p> <p>If I don't please him, and we don't manage to break the sentient AI that controls all organic life on this planet, then we're both in a whole heap of trouble.</p> <p>Although, given the way he's been looking at me lately, I think I'm already in more trouble than I ever dreamed possible . . .</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
